logs_pkl/
logs_pkl_FPS*/

# Root-level scratch scripts/notes. The repo root is the CWD for every script
# invocation, so new .py/.md files naturally land here and then get COPIED
# (not moved) into data_process/ | model_eval/ | data_visual_script/ |
# data_analysis_script/ and committed from there -- leaving the root original
# untracked forever, silently rotting out of sync with the real copy.
# These patterns are ROOT-ONLY (leading slash), so subfolders stay tracked.
# To add a genuinely new top-level script, use `git add -f <file>`.
/*.py
/*.md
!/README.md
!/DOCUMENTATION_INDEX.md
!/PROJECT_SUMMARY.md
!/QUICK_REFERENCE.md
!/download_from_hf.py
gear_sonic_deploy/reference/recorded_motion/
gear_sonic_deploy/reference/evaluation_set/

# Excluded/QC-filtered raw motion .pkl clips (data, not source content) and
# scratch/backup files left over from editing.
data_process/excluded_clips/
*.bak
gear_sonic/scripts/note.txt

